cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, we'd be grateful if you cited it as below. A credit link is welcome but never required."
type: dataset
title: "Bible Data from Christian Pure"
abstract: >-
  Six open datasets behind Christian Pure's free Bible and church tools: Paul's missionary
  journeys (stops, legs and places, as CSV and GeoJSON); 378 saints with their feast days in
  the Western and Orthodox calendars, patronages and sources; 22 Christian churches and
  traditions, and Protestants in general, on 55 questions, each answered from the church's
  own documents; Western and Orthodox Easter dates from 1900 to 2099; the 151 places named
  in the Gospels and Acts, with their names in 11 languages; and 6,699 Bible subjects with
  their verses.
authors:
  - name: "Christian Pure"
    website: "https://christianpure.com/"
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - CC0-1.0
url: "https://christianpure.com/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/christianpure/bible-data"
keywords:
  - Bible
  - Acts of the Apostles
  - Paul's missionary journeys
  - historical geography
  - saints
  - feast days
  - Christian denominations
  - Easter
  - computus
  - Bible geography
  - topical Bible
  - open data
